  "keyFeatures": [
    "16-stage modular security review pipeline (history → report)",
    "Platform-agnostic: works with Gemini CLI, Antigravity CLI, Google ADK, and custom harnesses",
    "Pluggable sandbox environments: static-only, gVisor, MicroSandbox, and GCE",
    "Tiered vulnerability deduplication using exact heuristics, RCA normalization, and semantic embeddings",
    "Snapshot-per-pass model for continuous reviews of living codebases",
    "SAST tool ingestion via a platform-agnostic JSONL IR adapter",
    "Automated exploit chain construction combining multiple low-severity findings",
    "Patch generation with re-attack variant testing for VERIFIED_SECURE status",
    "Risk calibration using a Mantis Risk Score matrix (1–10)",
    "ADK reference implementation with declarative workflow graph and layered config overlay",
    "Specialized domain support: RTL/hardware, IaC, ML pipelines, compiled firmware",
    "OKF v0.2 knowledge format with bi-directional bundle import/export"
  ],
